        "detailed_description": "<h1>EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/f6f284381d03fa33662284107a82a62e.avif?t=1789029751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras_big/f6f284381d03fa33662284107a82a62e.webp?t=1789029751 width=1560 height=881 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. Survive the nights, survey further into the unknown and track down the source of these rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey the Unknown</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survey the unknown to expand the map. Different towers can benefit from different geography, so choose carefully Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your Towers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tower upgrades from a market that strengthen your towers and can even grant new effects. Discover different combinations and strategies every expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.mp4?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover alien Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful artifacts to augment your defense. Finding the right combinations can take your defenses to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander Selection</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different commanders, each with their own three starting towers, abilities and passive. Each offers their own play style and strategy. Master them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.mp4?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your defense in Endless Mode</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 25 nights and enter Endless mode, testing the limits of your defenses!  </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. Survive the nights, survey further into the unknown and track down the source of these rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey the Unknown</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survey the unknown to expand the map. Different towers can benefit from different geography, so choose carefully Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your Towers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tower upgrades from a market that strengthen your towers and can even grant new effects. Discover different combinations and strategies every expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.mp4?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover alien Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful artifacts to augment your defense. Finding the right combinations can take your defenses to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander Selection</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different commanders, each with their own three starting towers, abilities and passive. Each offers their own play style and strategy. Master them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.poster.avif?t=1789029751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.webm?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.mp4?t=1789029751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your defense in Endless Mode</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 25 nights and enter Endless mode, testing the limits of your defenses!  </p>",
